{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"紧支集直像"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"紧支集直像"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>紧支集直像 (direct image with compact support, 又叫紧支集前推) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"六函子","text":"六函子"}},{"Plain":"之一.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>局部紧 Hausdorff 空间</h3>\n<p>对于局部紧 Hausdorff 空间 $X,Y$ 之间的映射 $f\\colon  X\\to Y$, 紧支集直像函子 $f_!$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"直像","text":"直像"}},{"Plain":"函子 $f_*\\colon \\operatorname{Sh}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Sh}(Y)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"子对象","text":"子"}},{"Plain":"函子. 对 $X$ 上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel层","text":"Abel 层"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal F$ 与,\n$$\r\nf_!\\mathcal F (U)= \\{s\\in f_*\\mathcal F(U) \\colon f|_{\\operatorname{supp}(s)}\\text{紧合}\\}.\r\n$$\n其中 $\\operatorname{supp}(s)$ 是 $f^{-1}(U)$ 的子集.</p>\n"}]}}